.inscriptiones.org/epig10001415\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001415\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Nenci 1997 1191-1192 tav.234.2 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001729\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001729\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> De Vido 2003 400 no.12 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002041\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002041\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 2008 87 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000160\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000160\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ampolo and Erdas 2019 G27 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001036\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001036\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":268,"html":269},"handnote","\u003Cp>The letters are somewhat worn, but present a regular and wide/square module, broadly and deeply incised. Alpha with straight bar, epsilon with shorter middle bar, omicron smaller and above the line, rho with a small closed eye.\u003C/p> Line 1  13-17 (13 = omicron)  Interlineation line 1 to 2    ",{"id":271,"html":272},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[274,276,279,280],{"html":275},"Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/3PK3JKXR\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/3PK3JKXR\u003C/a>",{"id":277,"lang":132,"html":278},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀππειραῖον\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀππειραῖον\">Ἀπ̣π̣